pping of oat (<i>Avena sativa</i>) and rye (<i>Secale cereale</i>) in Brastad, Lysekil Municipality, Sweden. The track by the field is abundant with broadleaf plantain (<i>Plantago major</i>). The left field has grass for <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/silage\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:silage\">silage</a>."},"DateTimeOriginal":{"value":"2018-07-10 20:21:29"},"Artist":{"value":"<a href=\"//commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/User:W.carter\" title=\"User:W.carter\">W.carter</a>"},"LicenseShortName":{"value":"CC0"}}}]},{"pageid":86493357,"title":"File:Field and silage bales in Övre Tuntorp 3.jpg","imageinfo":[{"thumburl":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e4/Field_and_silage_bales_in_%C3%96vre_Tuntorp_3.jpg/960px-Field_and_silage_bales_in_%C3%96vre_Tuntorp_3.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","descriptionurl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Field_and_silage_bales_in_%C3%96vre_Tuntorp_3.jpg","extmetadata":{"ImageDescription":{"value":"Field with white silage bales in Övre Tuntorp, Brastad, Lysekil Municipality, Sweden."},"DateTimeOriginal":{"value":"2019-06-30 18:34:47"},"Artist":{"value":"<a href=\"//commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/User:W.carter\" title=\"User:W.carter\">W.carter</a>"},"LicenseShortName":{"value":"CC0"}}}]},{"pageid":99688833,"title":"File:Field sparrow in CP (41484) (cropped).jpg","imageinfo":[{"thumburl":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/3c/Field_sparrow_in_CP_%2841484%29_%28cropped%29.jpg/960px-Field_sparrow_in_CP_%2841484%29_%28cropped%29.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","descriptionurl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Field_sparrow_in_CP_(41484)_(cropped).jpg","extmetadata":{"ImageDescription":{"value":"Field sparrow in Central Park, New York."},"DateTimeOriginal":{"value":"2021-02-04 17:04:50"},"Artist":{"value":"<a href=\"//commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/User:Rhododendrites\" title=\"User:Rhododendr